las/kansas/gove-county"],["ARC or PLC in Gove County","/arc-plc/kansas/gove-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March has come in under 90% of normal in 42 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. In 2026, the county&rsquo;s middle value had February to March at 11% of normal and March to April at 20%. Grid 22318 had its driest year in 2022 at 41% of normal.</p>"}
